  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CITI-Apteka Pharmasoft</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The venture created and offers a software service platform for pharmaceutical inventory management to enable community pharmacies, drug shops and hospital pharmacies to track purchases, stock movement cycle, medicine consumption and AI to forecast demand, and overall improve the efficiency of the procurement and supply chain planning process. The flagship product Pharmacy Portal is a versatile and an affordable inventory management software, which helps community pharmacies manage sales and inventory, source quality medication, and provide discounts and subsidies management especially for medicine for malaria, HIV AIDs etc.</narrative>
  </description>
